                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6d80defe-7f03-3616-98b4-7105117c7796",
                        "entry_id": "d9675341-5885-33de-bb56-a68b8926a5e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Peur de rougir, éreuthophobie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1992326d-8cdf-415b-b600-e4d618fb1783",
                                "sense_id": "6d80defe-7f03-3616-98b4-7105117c7796",
                                "text": "L’érythrophobie est une autre névrose de performance comparable au bégaiement et à la crampe de l'écrivain. Dans ce cas encore, l'anxiété de performance perturbe une motricité involontaire. Cette fois-ci il ne s'agit plus de mouvements automatiques mais de motricité végétative. […]. Ainsi l’érythrophobie combine une peur de rougir pathologique et un rougissement excessif dans des situations qui ne le justifient pas."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a6b1fcf-7465-43c9-98da-631a7cba6615",
                                "sense_id": "6d80defe-7f03-3616-98b4-7105117c7796",
                                "text": "On sait également par la Correspondance que Mme G. avait une « phobie des yeux »; on connaît aussi l'importance de l'analyse des érythrophobies associées par Ferenczi à l'énurésie et à sa punition, à la fureur et à la honte."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c429335a-af7b-365d-b5d1-2822ccfc96fc",
                        "entry_id": "d9675341-5885-33de-bb56-a68b8926a5e6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Peur maladive de la couleur rouge."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a6cad072-a011-4f44-95d1-26a0b5eaf214",
                        "source_entry_id": "d9675341-5885-33de-bb56-a68b8926a5e6",
                        "target_lang_word": "erythrophobia",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "erythrophobia",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b59ae72f-6e7a-3dc1-a248-a4fb8670ea7d",
                                        "entry_id": "bc7b1c65-b308-3b2f-b395-a4cc2281bb17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "abnormal and persistent fear of blushing"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2400a11e-1214-4203-966d-724911b23b0a",
                                                "sense_id": "b59ae72f-6e7a-3dc1-a248-a4fb8670ea7d",
                                                "text": "Erythophobia is no laughing matter if you are a sufferer of this phobia. It could tend to make the sufferer anti-social as it is a very real and serious concern that excessive blushing could occur at any moment."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c18a37b0-04d0-3525-9be0-ec78b28a8745",
                                        "entry_id": "bc7b1c65-b308-3b2f-b395-a4cc2281bb17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abnormal and persistent fear of the colour red."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b56b90f-43b4-44d7-a98d-bda84e8659d4",
                                                "sense_id": "c18a37b0-04d0-3525-9be0-ec78b28a8745",
                                                "text": "As they passed through the upper hall J. noticed that the carpet was red. This immediately brought back to her mind the recollection of the suicide and produced a peculiar feeling of fear,—erythrophobia,—which was immediately followed by pain in the back of her head...\nThe erythrophobia and the suicidal obsession, which did not yield to the influence of hypnotic suggestion, entirely disappeared and sank at once into the background."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a1b8996-5ca8-4a87-9121-206c97886221",
                                                "sense_id": "c18a37b0-04d0-3525-9be0-ec78b28a8745",
                                                "text": "This woman exhibited erythrophobia, i. e., fear of red, and at the same time she believed that she was responsible for or had actually caused the death of her mother."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3627e65d-062d-42a9-82de-4301075e5380",
                                                "sense_id": "c18a37b0-04d0-3525-9be0-ec78b28a8745",
                                                "text": "Red Coats. Red Cat. And she had erythrophobia...morbid fear of the color red...ailurophobia...morbid fear of cats."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c1450c9-c6f3-4978-b511-0cae394c448e",
                                                "sense_id": "c18a37b0-04d0-3525-9be0-ec78b28a8745",
                                                "text": "Or, maybe it's erythrophobia, which no real spanker/spankee should have. (For those who are logophobic, erythrophobia is an abnormal fear of the color red. Not one of my problems! :)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1d4b4b2-ced1-4d3b-9fea-895a494e0e22",
                                                "sense_id": "c18a37b0-04d0-3525-9be0-ec78b28a8745",
                                                "text": "With over 250 coffeeshops (p129), the capital offers ample opportunity to partake in a spliff or two, and no one, but no one (unless they suffer from erythrophobia) should miss a stroll through Amsterdam’s legendary Red Light District (p85)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85bf01d8-3882-4dff-ac5f-ae4f0b0c90ae",
                                                "sense_id": "c18a37b0-04d0-3525-9be0-ec78b28a8745",
                                                "text": "‘As in xenophobia?’ said Jack. ‘Or erythrophobia? I know some people really hate my red eyes.’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
